 "answer_verbatim": "For a small business, **BrightLocal’s Local AI Visibility Tracker** is a good fit if you serve a specific area: it’s built around local search and starts at about **$31/month**, with tracking for ChatGPT and Google’s AI search features.\n\nIf you want to check several AI platforms—not just local results—**Otterly.AI** is a budget-friendly alternative, starting around **$25–29/month**. Its plans track a set of customer-style questions across multiple engines; check the current plan details to confirm which engines are included.\n\nWhichever you choose, track questions real customers might ask, such as “best [service] in [town],” and compare results over time. These tools sample answers, which can vary by wording, location, and date; they’re useful for spotting trends, not a guarantee of what every customer will see.",
